+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, oracle
+    :tickets: 4157
+
+    Fixed regression where the removal of most setinputsizes
+    rules from cx_Oracle dialect impacted the TIMESTAMP
+    datatype's ability to retrieve fractional seconds.
+
+
